#: plugins/wjs_review/templates/wjs_review/revision/elements/info.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <p>\n"
"        You have chosen to have the previous version of your manuscript "
"reconsidered for publication.\n"
"      </p>\n"
"      <ol>\n"
"        <li>Check your manuscript’s file(s). If any file needs changes, "
"please go back and click “submit revision”.</li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Add a cover letter (text and/or file) to the editor in charge, "
"which the editor in charge may choose to share with any selected "
"reviewer(s). Make sure you <strong>save your cover letter before completing "
"the resubmission</strong> to avoid losing its content.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Check the box in the “Finishing up” section\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Click “Upload”.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"      </ol>\n"
"      Please make sure you <strong>save any updates to the metadata and the "
"cover letter to avoid losing their content</strong>.\n"
"    "
