"        You are going to submit a revised version of your manuscript.\n"
"      </p>\n"
"      <ol>\n"
"        <li>Update the metadata, if needed.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Add a cover letter (text and/or file) to the editor in charge, "
"which the editor in charge may choose to share with any selected "
"reviewer(s).\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Submit the source file of your revised manuscript and any "
"necessary supplementary files.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Check the boxes in the “Finishing up” section.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
